@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Movement warm-up
Movement warm-up. Two minutes of moves as I call them, then two minutes of split steps at the T,
taking two steps toward each call.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 4:00
0:00 [go]
0:01 Jog round the court.
8% Side-steps.
17% Lunges, alternating legs.
25% Open and close the hips.
33% High knees.
42% Arm circles, both directions.
50% Back to the T. Split steps now.
52% @random{fill, no repeats} [easy all]
---
[stop]
